{
  "description": "Tableau 公式解析語料：formula 解析後的 S 運算式應等於 sexpr；error 表示應該解析失敗且訊息包含此文字。Python 與未來的 TypeScript 解析器共用。",
  "cases": [
    {"formula": "1", "sexpr": "1"},
    {"formula": "1.5", "sexpr": "1.5"},
    {"formula": ".25", "sexpr": "0.25"},
    {"formula": "1e3", "sexpr": "1000.0"},
    {"formula": "-3", "sexpr": "-3"},
    {"formula": "'it''s'", "sexpr": "\"it's\""},
    {"formula": "\"say \"\"hi\"\"\"", "sexpr": "\"say \\\"hi\\\"\""},
    {"formula": "TRUE", "sexpr": "TRUE"},
    {"formula": "false", "sexpr": "FALSE"},
    {"formula": "Null", "sexpr": "NULL"},
    {"formula": "#2024-01-31#", "sexpr": "#2024-01-31#"},
